      "content": "Use Temporal.Instant.compare here so ordering matches the new time validator and Trade Record's ordering. Temporal accepts annotated instants such as `2026-10-12T20:45:00Z[UTC]`, but Date.parse returns NaN for them. With a Tuesday execution first and that Monday execution second, this reduction keeps Tuesday; reversing the members selects Monday. The Hold cutoff (and therefore whether a Plan Departure Reason is required) remains order-dependent for inputs that pass unreadableTimeIssues. Add an annotated-timestamp regression case as well.",
